codex
The estimates are tightly aligned: pooled TWFE is −0.0365 log points, and the robust ATT estimates are about −0.0400. The Bacon decomposition finds only 5.4% of identifying weight in the specifically problematic later-versus-earlier comparison type, versus 86.3% clean treated-versus-never-treated weight. I’m doing a final output and visual check now.
